+bound; Pinsker gives the third \citep[Theorem~31]{vanerven2014renyi}.
+For $w_b<1$, equality in the first is attained by
+$p_b=\ell_-(w_b,D)$ and
+$p_j=(1-p_b)w_j/(1-w_b)$ on the remaining bank, with zero mass elsewhere.
